.IX Title "Lucy::Index::LexiconReader 3pm"
.TH Lucy::Index::LexiconReader 3pm 2026-09-16 "perl v5.40.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
Lucy::Index::LexiconReader \- Read Lexicon data.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 2
\&    my $lex_reader = $seg_reader\->obtain("Lucy::Index::LexiconReader");
\&    my $lexicon    = $lex_reader\->lexicon( field => \*(Aqtitle\*(Aq );
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
LexiconReader reads term dictionary information.
.SH "ABSTRACT METHODS"
.IX Header "ABSTRACT METHODS"
.SS lexicon
.IX Subsection "lexicon"
.Vb 4
\&    my $lexicon = $lexicon_reader\->lexicon(
\&        field => $field,  # required
\&        term  => $term,   # default: undef
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Return a new Lexicon for the given \f(CW\*(C`field\*(C'\fR.  Will return
undef if either the field is not indexed, or if no documents
contain a value for the field.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBfield\fR \- Field name.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBterm\fR \- Pre-locate the Lexicon to this term.
.SS doc_freq
.IX Subsection "doc_freq"
.Vb 4
\&    my $int = $lexicon_reader\->doc_freq(
\&        field => $field,  # required
\&        term  => $term,   # required
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Return the number of documents where the specified term is present.
.SH METHODS
.IX Header "METHODS"
.SS aggregator
.IX Subsection "aggregator"
.Vb 4
\&    my $result = $lexicon_reader\->aggregator(
\&        readers => $readers,  # required
\&        offsets => $offsets,  # required
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Return a LexiconReader which merges the output of other
LexiconReaders.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBreaders\fR \- An array of LexiconReaders.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBoffsets\fR \- Doc id start offsets for each reader.
.SH INHERITANCE
.IX Header "INHERITANCE"
Lucy::Index::LexiconReader isa Lucy::Index::DataReader isa Clownfish::Obj.
